From 3534297e8825e8ecaefdcbfe123ac75bcd43fdbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:29:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0227: launcher cartridge cover-flow picker (second style)

Keep the 0226 classic outfit grid as the default ("classic") and add
the v4 cartridge cover-flow as a second picker ("cartridge"), chosen
by DmLauncherUIStyle (UserDefaults, default "classic") with a switch
in the Game tab's settings; switching takes effect immediately.

Cartridge cards are retro matte brick-red game cartridges (grain tile,
top notch, gold fingers, aged-paper label, sticker render with no
white edge), tilted in 3D by scroll position (+-68 deg), with
reflections below near-center cards only, spring snap-to-center, and a
tap-to-open lid (hinged left, 103 deg, overshoot ease) revealing the
interior page; the hero syncs and shows the gold "selected" badge
while a lid is open. Both pickers share the DmCharSelect.* cap/clothes
state, so switching styles never loses the pick.
